WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.672
O‘tgan darsdagi usul faqat eksponenta, ko‘phad, sinus va kosinus uchun ishlardi.

2
00:00:06.672 --> 00:00:12.336
Ammo o‘ng tomon bir bo‘lingan kosinus iks yoki tangens iks bo‘lsa-chi?

3
00:00:12.336 --> 00:00:17.904
Bugun universal usulni o‘rganamiz: o‘zgarmaslarni variatsiyalash.

4
00:00:17.904 --> 00:00:24.974
U har qanday uzluksiz o‘ng tomon va hatto o‘zgaruvchan koeffitsiyentlar uchun ishlaydi.

5
00:00:25.224 --> 00:00:34.392
G‘oya: bir jinsli yechim C bir y bir plyus C ikki y ikki dagi o‘zgarmaslarni iks ning funksiyalariga aylantiramiz.

6
00:00:34.392 --> 00:00:38.448
Ikki noma’lum funksiya uchun ikki shart qo‘yamiz.

7
00:00:38.448 --> 00:00:44.520
Birinchisi: C bir shtrix y bir plyus C ikki shtrix y ikki teng nol.

8
00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:53.294
Ikkinchisi tenglamadan kelib chiqadi: C bir shtrix y bir shtrix plyus C ikki shtrix y ikki shtrix teng f.

9
00:00:53.544 --> 00:00:58.464
Bu sistemaning determinanti Vronskian, u noldan farqli.

10
00:00:58.464 --> 00:01:07.896
Kramer qoidasi bilan: C bir shtrix teng minus y ikki f bo‘lingan W, C ikki shtrix teng y bir f bo‘lingan W.

11
00:01:07.896 --> 00:01:16.344
Muhim ogohlantirish: bu formulalar faqat y ikki shtrix oldidagi koeffitsiyent birga teng bo‘lganda to‘g‘ri.

12
00:01:16.344 --> 00:01:20.462
Aks holda avval tenglamani unga bo‘ling.

13
00:01:20.712 --> 00:01:29.232
Misol: y ikki shtrix plyus y teng bir bo‘lingan kosinus iks, minus pi yarimdan pi yarimgacha oraliqda.

14
00:01:29.232 --> 00:01:37.560
Bir jinsli yechimlar kosinus iks va sinus iks, Vronskian kosinus kvadrat plyus sinus kvadrat, ya’ni bir.

15
00:01:37.560 --> 00:01:39.854
Juda qulay.

16
00:01:40.104 --> 00:01:45.168
C bir shtrix teng minus sinus iks bo‘lingan kosinus iks,

17
00:01:45.168 --> 00:01:51.336
integrali natural logarifm kosinus iks; bu oraliqda kosinus musbat.

18
00:01:51.336 --> 00:01:57.336
C ikki shtrix teng kosinus bo‘lingan kosinus, ya’ni bir, integrali iks.

19
00:01:57.336 --> 00:02:04.238
Xususiy yechim: kosinus iks marta logarifm kosinus iks plyus iks sinus iks.

20
00:02:04.488 --> 00:02:07.392
Normallashtirish nega muhim?

21
00:02:07.392 --> 00:02:15.528
Iks kvadrat y ikki shtrix minus ikki iks y shtrix plyus ikki y teng iks kub tenglamani oling.

22
00:02:15.528 --> 00:02:20.016
Iks kvadratga bo‘lsak, f teng iks, iks kub emas.

23
00:02:20.016 --> 00:02:23.928
To‘g‘ri hisob iks kub bo‘lingan ikkini beradi.

24
00:02:23.928 --> 00:02:32.246
Agar bo‘lishni unutsak, iks beshinchi daraja bo‘lingan o‘n ikki chiqadi va u tenglamani qanoatlantirmaydi.

25
00:02:32.496 --> 00:02:40.176
Grafikda xususiy yechim kosinus iks marta logarifm kosinus iks plyus iks sinus iks ko‘rsatilgan.

26
00:02:40.176 --> 00:02:47.304
Iks pi yarimga yaqinlashganda kuch cheksiz o‘sadi, lekin yechimning o‘zi chegaralangan qoladi.

27
00:02:47.304 --> 00:02:55.526
Yechim faqat boshlang‘ich nuqtani o‘z ichiga olgan oraliqda, ya’ni minus pi yarimdan pi yarimgacha mavjud.

28
00:02:55.776 --> 00:03:02.736
Savol: y ikki shtrix plyus y teng tangens iks uchun C ikki shtrix nimaga teng?

29
00:03:02.736 --> 00:03:08.784
Y bir kosinus iks, Vronskian bir ekanini eslang va formulaga qo‘ying.

30
00:03:08.784 --> 00:03:12.614
Videoni to‘xtatib, javobni tanlang.
